# Chain of Custody

Category: Forensics
Difficulty: Medium–Hard
Flag format: flag{...}

Description:
An evidence locker intake photo was pulled from the lab's imaging
station before the chain-of-custody log was filled in. The technician
swears the real evidence marker is "in there somewhere," but everything
you've found so far smells like a decoy.

Don't trust the first flag-shaped string you find.

Files:
evidence.png

## Notes:

- One flag is real. At least one is not.
- The camera that took this photo stamps something useful into every
  image it produces — you just have to know where to look, and what
  to do with it once you find it.
